      ],
      "blocks": {
        "text_mRz8Ek": {
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h3>WORN OFTEN, WORN IN, PASSED DOWN</h3><p>Handcrafted in Japan by skilled artisans, we use the highest quality Japanese denim and time-honored techniques, upholding responsible manufacturing methods that honor both people and the environment. Each piece is meticulously crafted, undergoing nearly 100 steps to produce a single garment.</p><p>Our denim is 100% cotton, with thoughtful touches like contrast topstitching, hand-tacked embroidery instead of rivets for softness, and adjustable waistbands and straps for long wear and the perfect fit. Our denim has no stretch — yet has a naturally soft hand-feel and is effortlessly versatile.</p><p>Designed for comfort and made for long wear — denim to be worn often, worn in, and passed down.</p>",
            "text_style": "body",
            "tg_color": "#1a1a1a",
            "tg_custom_font": "default",
            "tg_enable_padding": true,
            "tg_enable_type": true,
